            plan and run bootcamps and workshops, including hands-on sessions with XRP robots,
            and handle the programme planning and partnerships behind them.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:0">
            Rooted Tech helped establish the robotics club I came up through, and in 2025 we
            took that team to the FIRST Robotics Competition in New York with barely any
            funding, placing 27th out of 53 teams as a rookie international team.
          </p>
